{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And he saw the calf and the dancing.</b> The heh of העגל serves on account of the other one [i.e., the previously mentioned calf], as in \"and he saw the calf and the dancing around it.\" And from the intensity of Moses' zeal he broke the tablets that were in his hands, like a deed of testimony — behold, he tore up the deed of stipulations. And this was before the eyes of all Israel, as it is written:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:48.301396696Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}